<title>UK: Novorossiisk crude pipeline down for 4-5 days.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk crude pipeline down for 4-5 days.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's leading oil terminal Black Sea Novorossiisk closed its export pipeline for repairs on Wednesday, a local shipping inspection company said.</p>
<p>The 650,000 barrel a day pipeline would be down for four or five days, the shipper said.</p>
<p>The port's largest berth has been shut for repairs since December 9 and is expected back in service on December 24.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
